Output site/docs/assets/heimdall-tui-demo.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set FontSize 24
Set Width 2000
Set Height 1000
Set PlaybackSpeed 0.5
Set WindowBar Colorful

# Setup
Hide
Type "alias heimdall=/Users/yodamad/work/github/heimdall/heimdall"
Enter
Type 'clear' Enter
Sleep 100ms
Show

Type "heimdall -w ~/work/demo/yodamad-actions"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 1s
Type "a"
Sleep 500ms
Type "f"
Sleep 3s
Type "u"
Sleep 1s
Type "p"
Sleep 1s
Type "y"
Sleep 3s
Escape
Type "!"
Sleep 500ms
Type "git status -sb"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "q"
Sleep 500ms
